A change of packages/fcl-passrc/src/pparser.pp of Free Pascal 3.2.2 (tag release_3_2_2), applied by get.sh.
Licence of this patch: that of the patched file, the LGPL with the static linking exception of Free Pascal (COPYING.FPC
in the FPC sources); see README.md.

1. TPasParser.ParseSimpleType: String[N] (a short string) is a type in any place, a variable or a field too, also when
   the resolver is used (po_ResolveStandardTypes); 3.2.2 accepts it there only without the resolver.

--- a/packages/fcl-passrc/src/pparser.pp
+++ b/packages/fcl-passrc/src/pparser.pp
@@ -1585,7 +1585,7 @@
       K:=stkAlias;
       UnGetToken;
       end
-    else if IsFull and (CurToken=tkSquaredBraceOpen) then
+    else if (IsFull or (LowerCase(Name)='string')) and (CurToken=tkSquaredBraceOpen) then
       begin
       if LowerCase(Name)='string' then // Type A = String[12]; shortstring
         K:=stkString
